\newlabel{fig:manifold}{{8}{13}{Manifold geometry by symmetry condition. Top: online intrinsic dimensionality estimates during training converge to 5.7--6.0. Bottom: t-SNE visualizations (PCA to 64D first). S1 shows continuous gradient; S4 shows fragmented multi-arm structure; S2 shows symmetric two-lobe structure.\relax }{figure.caption.8}{}}
